# Pull request assignee

When creating or finishing a GitHub pull request (MR) for this repo, **always assign Bahaa Kaaki**.

## `gh pr create`

Include the assignee flag on every `gh pr create`:

```bash
gh pr create ... --assignee bahaa-kaaki_pwcit
```

If the command was already run without `--assignee`, immediately run:

```bash
gh pr edit <PR_NUMBER> --add-assignee bahaa-kaaki_pwcit
```

## After merge / handoff

Before reporting the PR URL to the user, confirm assignee is set (`gh pr view <n> --json assignees`). Add the assignee if missing.

## Do not

- Skip assignee for "small" or chore PRs.
- Use `@me` unless `gh api user` confirms the login is `bahaa-kaaki_pwcit` (prefer the explicit login for this org).
